    <l n="1" type="heading" level="1" caput="8" para="true">LIBER VIII.</l>
    <l n="2" type="heading" level="1" caput="8">De Animalibus in Communi.</l>
    <l n="3" type="heading" level="2" caput="1" para="true">CAPUT I.</l>
    <l n="4" type="heading" level="2" caput="1">De Animalium natura &amp;</l>
    <l n="5" type="heading" level="2" caput="1">principiis.</l>
    <l n="6" para="true">I. <i>Absoluta tractatione de plan-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="7">
      <i>tis, sequitur Animalium tra-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="8">
      <i>ctatio: est vero animal vivum</i>
    </l>
    <l n="9">
      <i>sentiens.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="10" para="true">§. Vitam animal cum plantis com-</l>
    <l n="11">munem habet, sed sentiendi vim pro-</l>
    <l n="12">priam: proinde sic animal per genus &amp;</l>
    <l n="13">differentiam propriam explicavimus.</l>
    <l n="14" para="true">II. <i>Vt vero hujus naturam debit-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="15">
      <i>e explicemus, primum principia ejus, inter-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="16">
      <i>na maxime explicabimus, &amp; deinde</i>
    </l>
    <l n="17">
      <i>ostendemus quomodo ex iisdem adjuncta</i>
    </l>
    <l n="18">
      <i>&amp; effecta animalium proveniant.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="19" para="true">§. Quod enim ad externa principia</l>
    <l n="20">attinet, <i>efficiens</i> non requirit peculia-</l>
    <l n="21">rem explicationem, quæ ex prioribus</l>
    <l n="22">hauriri non possit: &amp; præterea circa gene-</l>
  </main_text>
